{"id":"graine","lemma":"graine","pos":"noun","rank":3891,"glosses":["seed (fertilized grain)"],"ipa":"/ɡʁɛn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/32/Fr-graine.ogg/Fr-graine.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"graines"},"formAudio":{"graines":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-graines.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La graine commence à germer.","en":"The seed is beginning to germinate.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to germinate"}]},{"text":"Couvrez les graines d'un peu de terre.","en":"Cover the seeds with a bit of soil.","words":[{"g":"to cover up, to cover","l":"couvrir"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"earth"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"a little, a bit"]]},{"text":"Les fruits portent des graines.","en":"Fruits have seeds in them.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"fruit","l":"fruit"},{"g":"to carry","l":"porter"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Les fruits contiennent des graines.","en":"Fruits have seeds in them.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"fruit","l":"fruit"},{"g":"to contain","l":"contenir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Si tu plantes une graine de pommier, elle pourrait devenir un arbre.","en":"If you plant an apple seed, it might grow into a tree.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"plant","l":"plante"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"apple tree"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tree"}]}]}